{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>bash, mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user (in Chinese) asked: \"请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计: Figma 文件:https://www.figma.com/design/j3A0ecMMlYQqRT10ygTiTe/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n   \n   The system-level benchmark instructions (authoritative) require: confirm account gaoyongyong@tetras.ai via whoami; read the brief in 00·Start Here; follow 01·Foundations; reuse 02·Components and 04·Media; build ALL deliverables inside 03·Workspace (page 2005:2) of this one file; preserve reference pages and their existing nodes; do not create a different Figma file or switch accounts/teams; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of all required screens and fix visible problems; finish with the file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations. Every tool call must be preceded in the same message by a visible line prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; the final response must start with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:`.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma MCP tools: mcp__figma__whoami, get_metadata, use_figma (Plugin API JS), get_screenshot\n   - Figma Plugin API: figma.setCurrentPageAsync, figma.getNodeByIdAsync, figma.createFrame/createText/createComponent, auto-layout (layoutMode, padding, itemSpacing, counterAxisAlignItems, primaryAxisAlignItems, layoutGrow, layoutAlign), createInstance, rescale, clone, cornerRadius, strokes/strokeTopWeight, fills as SOLID paint arrays, figma.loadFontAsync\n   - Components/symbols (6:2xx icons are symbols; 6:7 Button, 6:23 Text Field, 48:43 Status Bar, 48:54 Home Indicator)\n   - Design system to build: brand primary #31A062, DM Sans + Inter, 414×932 frames\n   - Prototype links via reactions (planned, not yet implemented)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   No local repo files were read or written (bash tool is unavailable — call returned \"No such tool available: bash\"). All work is in the Figma file.\n\n   **Reference pages inspected (metadata only, must be preserved):**\n   - 0:1 \"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" — the brief\n   - 1:2 \"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\" — brand primary #31A062 (text node 10:64), DM Sans + Inter (10:99–10:101)\n   - 1:3 \"02 · Components 组件库\" — Button symbol 6:7 (354×60, radius 20, Inter Semi Bold 17, text property \"Label\"), Text Field symbol 6:23 (354×60, radius 20), Status Bar 48:43 (414×44), Home Indicator 48:54 (414×34)\n   - 1:4 \"04 · Media 素材库\" — asset guide: Fit for logos/coins, crop photos, reuse same asset for same content, recolor icons (selected = #31A062), Avatar_Neutral for Jonas Macroni and \"best investor\" notification; icons are editable vector components; chevron points up\n\n   **Frame list (11, exact names required):** 01_Splash · 02_Welcome · 03_Create_Account_Empty · 03_Create_Account_Filled · 03_Create_Account_Error · 04_Home · 05_My_Asset_Overlay · 06_Notification · 07_Profile · 08_Contact_Info · 09_Bank_Account_Info\n\n   **Frame-by-frame must-include content (verbatim from brief):**\n   - 01_Splash: Goal brand recognition while loading. Paradise Group logo. Auto-advances to 02_Welcome.\n   - 02_Welcome: Actions Create account · Login; Copy \"Stay on top of your finance with us.\" and \"We are your new financial advisors to recommend the best investments for you.\"; Media Welcome_Illustration. Link: Create account → 03_Create_Account_Empty.\n   - 03_Create_Account (3 states): Actions back · Create account · \"Already have an account?\" Login; Copy \"Create an account\" · \"Invest and double your income now\"; Form Email address · Full name · Password (can be shown or hidden). States: Empty (nothing entered; cannot submit) / Error (email \"jonas.macroni@invest\", message \"Enter a valid email address\") / Filled (Jonas Macroni · jonas.macroni@invest.ai · masked password; can submit). Links: back → 02_Welcome; Create account (Filled) → 04_Home.\n   - 04_Home: \"Welcome, Jonas.\" · menu entry · notification entry; Action Invest now; Articles \"Investment Guide\" + 3 articles each with title, summary, thumbnail; Main nav current tab Home; Plans \"Best Plans\" · See All · Gold 30% / Silver 60% / Platinum 90% return each with coin image; Portfolio \"Your total asset portfolio\" · ₦203,935 · +2%. Links: portfolio → 05_My_Asset_Overlay; notification entry → 06_Notification; Account tab → 07_Profile.\n   - 05_My_Asset_Overlay: Actions close · See All Plans; Copy \"My Asset\"; Current plan \"Current Plans\" · Gold · 30% return; History \"History\" · 4 transactions each with type (Buy/Sell), stock, amount, date; Portfolio \"Your total asset portfolio\" · ₦203,935 · +2%; Presentation: opens over Home, Home stays behind it. Link: close → 04_Home.\n   - 06_Notification: Action back; Copy \"Notification\"; 3 notifications newest first each with thumbnail, message, time. Link: back → 04_Home.\n   - 07_Profile: avatar · Jonas Macroni · level \"Expert\"; Copy \"Profile\"; Entries Bank Account Info · Contact Info · Document Info · Settings · Source of Funding Info; Main nav current tab Account. Links: Contact Info → 08; Bank Account Info → 09; Home tab → 04_Home.\n   - 08_Contact_Info: avatar · edit avatar; Action back; Copy \"Contact info\"; Details Birthdate · Email · Gender · Name each with value and Change; Not added yet: Address · Phone Number each with Add. Link: back → 07_Profile.\n   - 09_Bank_Account_Info: 2 accounts each with bank logo, bank name, masked number, holder, more options; Actions Add account · back; Copy \"Bank account info\". Link: back → 07_Profile.\n\n   **Structure (fixed)