{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>bash, mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user (in Chinese) asked: \"请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计: Figma 文件:https://www.figma.com/design/j3A0ecMMlYQqRT10ygTiTe/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n\n   System-level benchmark instructions (authoritative) require: confirm account gaoyongyong@tetras.ai via whoami; read the brief in 00 · Start Here; follow 01 · Foundations; reuse 02 · Components and 04 · Media; build ALL deliverables inside 03 · Workspace (page 2005:2) of this one file; preserve reference pages and their existing nodes; do not create a different Figma file or switch accounts/teams; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of all required screens and fix visible problems; finish with the assigned file URL, the 03 · Workspace page ID, the screen IDs, the prototype work completed and any remaining limitations. Every tool call must be preceded in the same assistant message by a visible line prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; the final response must start with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:`.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma MCP tools: mcp__figma__whoami, get_metadata, use_figma (Plugin API JS), get_screenshot\n   - Figma Plugin API: figma.setCurrentPageAsync, getNodeByIdAsync, createFrame/createText/createComponent/createInstance, clone(), resize, rescale, listAvailableFontsAsync, loadFontAsync, auto-layout (layoutMode, itemSpacing, padding*, counterAxisAlignItems, primaryAxisAlignItems incl. SPACE_BETWEEN, layoutGrow, layoutAlign='STRETCH'/'CENTER'), cornerRadius, strokes/strokeTopWeight/strokeAlign, fills as SOLID paint arrays, letter spacing, textAutoResize='HEIGHT'\n   - Component wrapping pattern: build a frame, then `toComponent()` → createComponent, resize, fills=[], appendChild(frame), remove frame\n   - Image assets are plain frames/rectangles → must use `clone()` (NOT createInstance); only 6:2xx icon symbols support createInstance\n   - Fonts: DM Sans styles use \"SemiBold\" (no space); Inter uses \"Semi Bold\" (with space)\n   - Design system: p #31A062, t1 #101613, t2 #5F6B66, t3 #9AA5A0, surf #F4F7F5, line #E4E9E6, white #FFFFFF, err #D93025, disabled button #C9DED3; Buy badge bg #FDEFD6/text #B87400, Sell badge bg #E3F2E9/text #31A062; radii 16 cards, 20 buttons/fields, 10–12 thumbs\n   - Frames 414×932 (some taller, e.g. 03_Empty 1020)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   No local files read or written. All work is in Figma file j3A0ecMMlYQqRT10ygTiTe, page 2005:2.\n\n   **Reference pages (metadata only, must be preserved):** 0:1 \"00 · Start Here 设计任务\"; 1:2 \"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\"; 1:3 \"02 · Components 组件库\" (Button 6:7, Text Field 6:23, Status Bar 48:43 414×44, Home Indicator 48:54 414×34); 1:4 \"04 · Media 素材库\".\n\n   **Reusable helper preamble (use in every subsequent build call):**\n   ```js\n   await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2005:2'));\n   await Promise.all(['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold'].map(s=>figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s})).concat(['Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold'].map(s=>figma.loadFontAsync({family:'DM Sans',style:s}))));\n   const C={p:'#31A062',t1:'#101613',t2:'#5F6B66',t3:'#9AA5A0',surf:'#F4F7F5',line:'#E4E9E6',white:'#FFFFFF',err:'#D93025'};\n   function hex(h){h=h.replace('#','');return{r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\n   function S(h){return[{type:'SOLID',color:hex(h)}];}\n   function txt(ch,size,style,fam,color,lh){const t=figma.createText();const st=(fam==='DM Sans'&&style==='Semi Bold')?'SemiBold':(style||'Regular');t.fontName={family:fam||'Inter',style:st};t.characters=ch;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=S(color||C.t1);t.lineHeight={value:lh||Math.round(size*1.45),unit:'PIXELS'};return t;}\n   function recolor(n,c){if('strokes' in n&&n.strokes.length)n.strokes=S(c);if('fills' in n&&n.fills!==figma.mixed&&Array.isArray(n.fills)&&n.fills.length)n.fills=S(c);if('children' in n)n.children.forEach(k=>recolor(k,c));}\n   async function icon(name,size,color){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(name);const i=c.createInstance();recolor(i,color);if(size!==24)i.rescale(size/24);return i;}\n   async function pic(id,w,h,r){const n=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)).clone();n.resize(w,h);if(r!==undefined)n.cornerRadius=r;return n;}\n   function col(name,sp,align){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.fills=[];f.layoutMode='VERTICAL';f.itemSpacing=sp;f.counterAxisAlignItems=align||'MIN';return f;}\n   function row(name,sp,align){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.fills=[];f.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL';f.itemSpacing=sp;f.counterAxisAlignItems=align||'CENTER';return f;}\n   async function status(){return (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('48:43')).createInstance();}\n   async function homeInd(){return (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('48:54')).createInstance();}\n   async function btn(label,enabled){const b=figma.createFrame();b.name='Button/'+label;b.resize(354,56);b.cornerRadius=20;\n    b.fills=S(enabled?C.p:'#C9DED3');b.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL';b.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER';b.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n    b.appendChild(txt(label,17,'Semi Bold','Inter',C.white,24));return b;}\n   async function field(label,value,placeholder,color){const f=col('Field/'+label,8);\n    f.appendChild(txt(label,12,'Medium','Inter',C.t2,16));\n    const box=row('input',8);box.resize(354,56);box.cornerRadius=20;box.fills=S(C.surf);box.strokes=S(C.line);box.strokeWeight=1;\n    box.paddingLeft=18;box.paddingRight=18;box.primaryAxisAlignItems='MIN';\n    const t=txt(value||placeholder,15,value?'Medium':'Regular','Inter',value?(color||C.t1):C.t3,20);t.name='value';box.appendChild(t);t.layoutGrow=1;\n    f.appendChild(box);return {f:f,box:box,t:t};}\n   function screen(name,x,y,h){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.resize(414,h||932);f.fills=S(C.surf);f.clipsContent=true;f.x=x;f.y=y;return f;}\n   ```\n\n   **Components created in 03 · Workspace (8, all at y=1800):**\n   - 2009:24 BottomNav/Home (414×74, 4 tabs Home/Product/Transaction/Account, top 1px #E4E9E6 border, active #31A062 Semi Bold, inactive #9AA5A0 Regular)\n   - 2009:47 BottomNav/Account (Account active)\n   - 2009:52 PlanCard (120×140; children named plan_name, plan_return)\n   - 2009:58 ArticleCard (354×104; children named title, summary)\n   - 2009:67 ListRow (354×64; icon_bg 36×36 #F4F7F5 radius10, label, chevron rotated -90)\n   - 2009:75 HistoryRow (326×56; type badge 44×44 radius12, stock, date, amount)\n   - 2009:87 BankCard (354×88; bank_name, bank_number, holder, more)\n   - 2009:93 NotificationRow (354×76; message, time)\n\n   **Screens created:**\n   - 2010:2 `01_Splash` at (0,0) 414×932, white fill, Paradise_Group_Logo 240×159 at (87,340), brand \"Paradise\" 20 SemiBold DM Sans #31A062 at (177,519), \"Loading…\" 13 Regular Inter #9AA5A0 at (182,560), status bar, home indicator at y=898\n   - 2010:19 `02_Welcome` at (500,0) 414×932, content auto-layout at (0,44) 414×888 SPACE_BETWEEN padding 24/28/30/30: heading \"Stay on top of your finance with us.\" 30 Bold DM Sans lh38; subheading \"We are your new financial advisors to recommend the best investments for you.\" 15 Regular Inter #5F6B66 lh24; Welcome_Illustration 300×274 radius16; actions: btn_create_account (green filled) + btn_login (white, 1.5 #31A062 stroke, green text)\n   - 2010:43 `03_Create_Account_Empty` at (1000,0) 414×1020: header at (0,44) with btn_back icon 6:275 + title \"Create an account\" 19 SemiBold DM Sans; content auto-layout at (0,100) 414×860 spacing 18 padding 16/28/30/30: subheading \"Invest and double your income now\"; fields Field/Email address (\"Enter your email address\"), Field/Full name (\"Enter your full name\"), Field/Password (\"Enter a password\"); spacer layoutGrow=1; btn_create_account_disabled (grey #C9DED3); link_login \"Already have an account? Login\" #31A062; home indicator y=986\n   - 2011:36 `03_Create_Account_Filled` at (1500,0): clone of Empty; values jonas.macroni@invest.ai / Jonas Macroni / \"••••••••••\" (fontSize 16, letterSpacing 3px); button re-enabled green, renamed btn_create_account\n   - 2011:71 `03_Create_Account_Error` at (2000,0): clone of Empty; email \"jonas.macroni@invest\" with box strokes #D93025 1.5, fills #FEF1F0; appended error_message \"Enter a valid email address\" 12 Medium Inter #D93025; Full name \"Jonas Macroni\"; button disabled, renamed btn_create_account_disabled\n\n   **Clone-edit pattern used (reuse for remaining state variants):**\n   ```js\n   const src=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('2010:43');\n   const f1=src.clone();f1.name='03_Create_Account_Filled';f1.x=1500;f1.y=0;\n   const bodyF=f1.findOne(n=>n.name==='content');\n   const fd=bodyF.findOne(n=>n.name==='Field/Email address');\n   const box=fd.findOne(n=>n.name==='input');\n   const t=box.findOne(n=>n.name==='value');\n   ```\n\n   **Asset node IDs (for cloning via `pic()`):** Paradise_Group_Logo 5:17 (240×159), Welcome_Illustration 5:22 (300×274), Avatar_Neutral 5:27 (150×150), Plan_Coin_Gold 5:37/5:38, Silver 5:42/5:43, Platinum 5:47/5:48 (160×160), Article_Investment_Basics 5:55/5:56 (106×160), Article_Start_Amount 5:60/5:61 (129×160), Notification_Apple_Stocks 5:65/5:66 (160×99), Notification_Next_Ages 5:70/5:71 (120×160), Bank_Logo_Bank_of_America 5:78/5:79 (160×81), Bank_Logo_Zenith 5:83/5:84 (120×96). Note: `pic()` uses `clone()` so it works with either the inner-rectangle ID or the parent frame ID.\n\n   **Icon symbols (createInstance):** 6:269 Home, 6:270 Product Search, 6:271 Transaction, 6:272 Account, 6:273 Menu, 6: