heck it out now.\" 15 min ago)\n   - 07_Profile: Avatar_Neutral, Jonas Macroni, \"Expert\", \"Profile\", 5 ListRow instances (Bank Account Info, Contact Info, Document Info, Settings, Source of Funding Info), BottomNav/Account (2009:47)\n   - 08_Contact_Info: avatar + edit avatar (6:279), back, \"Contact info\"; Birthdate 05 November 1993 / Email jonas.macroni@invest.ai / Gender Male / Name Jonas Macroni each with Change; Address · Phone Number \"Not added yet\" with Add\n   - 09_Bank_Account_Info: back, \"Bank account info\", 2 BankCard instances (Bank of America 0182128xxx, Zenith Bank 0182128xxx, holder Jonas Macroni), Add account action\n   - Prototype reactions: Splash→Welcome; Welcome Create account→03_Empty; 03 back→Welcome; 03_Filled Create account→Home; Home portfolio→05, notification→06, Account tab→07; 05 close→Home; 06 back→Home; 07 Contact Info→08, Bank Account Info→09, Home tab→04; 08 back→07; 09 back→07\n   - Screenshot every required screen, fix issues, re-verify\n   - Final answer: file URL, page 2005:2 ID, screen IDs, prototype work, remaining limitations\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Immediately before this summary I completed the third build call of this session, cloning `03_Create_Account_Empty` (2010:43) twice to produce `03_Create_Account_Filled` (2011:36, at x=1500) and `03_Create_Account_Error` (2011:71, at x=2000). The tool returned `{\"filled\":\"2011:36\",\"error\":\"2011:71\"}`. My stated intent in that call's Reasoning summary was: \"现在克隆 03_Empty 生成 Filled 与 Error 两个状态并改写表单数据（Filled 填 Jonas Macroni / jonas.macroni@invest.ai / 掩码密码且可提交，Error 填 jonas.macroni@invest 并显示 \"Enter a valid email address\"）。\" Five of eleven frames now exist; the six main-flow screens (04–09) have not been started.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Build `04_Home` next, as a 414-wide scrollable frame using instances of the created components (BottomNav/Home 2009:24, PlanCard 2009:52, ArticleCard 2009:58) and the required content — \"Welcome, Jonas.\", menu/notification 